    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10245" root="خرب" body-key="x">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَرَبَةٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُرْبَةٌ</span>, in three places, near the end
of the paragraph. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذِلَّةٌ</span> [<i>Baseness,
vileness,</i> &amp;c.]: (K, TA:) in one copy of the
K, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَلَّةٌ</span> [<i>a slip, lapse, fault,</i> &amp;c.]: (TA:) and
<i>disgrace,</i> or <i>ignominy,</i> and <i>contemptibleness.</i>
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الخَرَبَةٌ</span> signifies <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العَوْرَةُ</span> [<i>The part,</i>
or <i>parts, of the person, which it is indecent to
expose</i>]. (K.)

